{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eufloria Classic brings back the original Strategy charms of the long-unavailable indie classic, updated for a new age with tons of new content and features, including extreme moddability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old school intergalactic floral warfare is BACK!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/extras/dbe5d8650ccdd83ae8c7b831e818122d.poster.avif?t=1764874637\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/extras/dbe5d8650ccdd83ae8c7b831e818122d.webm?t=1764874637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/extras/dbe5d8650ccdd83ae8c7b831e818122d.mp4?t=1764874637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow your own Units</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer asteroids in space and use their resources to grow <strong>floral creatures</strong> that do the player's bidding. <strong>Expand your empire</strong> and fight for resources against several teams of opponents that all vie for the same resources and can offer fierce opposition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/extras/0ce959360e0c73c2ed82627dbb59ee55.poster.avif?t=1764874637\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/extras/0ce959360e0c73c2ed82627dbb59ee55.webm?t=1764874637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/extras/0ce959360e0c73c2ed82627dbb59ee55.mp4?t=1764874637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Timeless, Gorgeous and Accessible</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Presented in a unique and gorgeous <strong>floral aesthetic</strong>, the game can be played competitively or in a relaxed, ambient style. <i>You</i> choose how to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/extras/d87bc3be007778451e3ed7ab72089ae8.poster.avif?t=1764874637\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/extras/d87bc3be007778451e3ed7ab72089ae8.webm?t=1764874637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/extras/d87bc3be007778451e3ed7ab72089ae8.mp4?t=1764874637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along a <strong>25 level campaign mode</strong>, a host of additional modes offer <strong>procedural levels</strong> that offer endless replayability. Add to that a vast number of <strong>mods and user levels</strong> plus an active mod community and you will not soon run out of challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/extras/98bf1d1d89681645ac432aec1767e6d6.poster.avif?t=1764874637\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/extras/98bf1d1d89681645ac432aec1767e6d6.webm?t=1764874637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/extras/98bf1d1d89681645ac432aec1767e6d6.mp4?t=1764874637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 level Single player campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Level \u201cSkirmish Mode\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable \u201cDark Matter\u201d mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hours of wonderful ambient music by \u201cMilieu\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural levels \u2013 great for replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But to <strong>celebrate</strong> the new release and reward loyal fans we have also added:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New \u201cRegrowth\u201d Game Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New &quot;Gardening&quot; Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New original music by \u201cMilieu&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced modding options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Speedup buttons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whole treasure trove of bonus files, art, stories, and concepts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Updated UI support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Updated Demo</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Starboretum","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3254570/3bb96462892b6246eb399894f1360abe10319a87.jpg"},{"name":"Illuminator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3254570/80b68c922fc20e613adf9ffb1a7a8481c3256c3c.jpg"},{"name":"Megalopolis","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3254570/146a6c2e15b708a9ae9032bfcc4a1f899c3c14bb.jpg"},{"name":"Safety","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3254570/8130e4363430f48d2bb3af46ecc254a41ca1e034.jpg"},{"name":"Lightyear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3254570/8886a2451b13a9b88b9587bc275cd5c00610e413.jpg"},{"name":"Lightsecond","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3254570/a7a480f625b6af342c7f42cac72ed595995d6e33.jpg"},{"name":"Pacifism","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3254570/0940b8c8f2a87be7a2b31f1b39532cb569c6b5b8.jpg"},{"name":"Martyrdom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3254570/0c141c2d80dc6d0f6d33ae2a6eba6af0c25e20a5.jpg"},{"name":"Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3254570/87215cef877472823b009ce38226746845fbba10.jpg"},{"name":"Aggressor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3254570/656f81c2372eb8dce7715cf6ba7a62fdb3bd4ea5.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3254570?t=1764874637","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3254570?t=1764874637","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/8854f4104935a8b82f146c5a4f4a83e5af0b6e52/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764874637","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/8854f4104935a8b82f146c5a4f4a83e5af0b6e52/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764874637","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4063340,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/extras/81310aa138c0daa7aced90b5a6e7e6ac.avif?t=1764874637\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/extras_big/81310aa138c0daa7aced90b5a6e7e6ac.avif?t=1764874637 width=800 height=208 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eufloria Classic brings back the original Strategy charms of the long-unavailable indie classic, updated for a new age with tons of new content and features, including extreme moddability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old school intergalactic floral warfare is BACK!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/extras/dbe5d8650ccdd83ae8c7b831e818122d.poster.avif?t=1764874637\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/extras/dbe5d8650ccdd83ae8c7b831e818122d.webm?t=1764874637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/extras/dbe5d8650ccdd83ae8c7b831e818122d.mp4?t=1764874637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow your own Units</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer asteroids in space and use their resources to grow <strong>floral creatures</strong> that do the player's bidding. <strong>Expand your empire</strong> and fight for resources against several teams of opponents that all vie for the same resources and can offer fierce opposition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/extras/0ce959360e0c73c2ed82627dbb59ee55.poster.avif?t=1764874637\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/extras/0ce959360e0c73c2ed82627dbb59ee55.webm?t=1764874637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/extras/0ce959360e0c73c2ed82627dbb59ee55.mp4?t=1764874637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Timeless, Gorgeous and Accessible</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Presented in a unique and gorgeous <strong>floral aesthetic</strong>, the game can be played competitively or in a relaxed, ambient style. <i>You</i> choose how to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/extras/d87bc3be007778451e3ed7ab72089ae8.poster.avif?t=1764874637\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/extras/d87bc3be007778451e3ed7ab72089ae8.webm?t=1764874637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/extras/d87bc3be007778451e3ed7ab72089ae8.mp4?t=1764874637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along a <strong>25 level campaign mode</strong>, a host of additional modes offer <strong>procedural levels</strong> that offer endless replayability. Add to that a vast number of <strong>mods and user levels</strong> plus an active mod community and you will not soon run out of challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/extras/98bf1d1d89681645ac432aec1767e6d6.poster.avif?t=1764874637\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/extras/98bf1d1d89681645ac432aec1767e6d6.webm?t=1764874637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/extras/98bf1d1d89681645ac432aec1767e6d6.mp4?t=1764874637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 level Single player campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Level \u201cSkirmish Mode\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable \u201cDark Matter\u201d mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hours of wonderful ambient music by \u201cMilieu\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural levels \u2013 great for replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But to <strong>celebrate</strong> the new release and reward loyal fans we have also added:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New \u201cRegrowth\u201d Game Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New &quot;Gardening&quot; Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New original music by \u201cMilieu&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced modding options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Speedup buttons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whole treasure trove of bonus files, art, stories, and concepts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Updated UI support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Updated Demo</p></li></ul>","developers":["Omni Systems"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254570/header.jpg?t=1764874637","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3254570/548698547/833c2f4630b085bf6ea0c7c7a4e8835d0dd12dc5/1761054113/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761054986","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3254570/548698547/833c2f4630b085bf6ea0c7c7a4e8835d0dd12dc5/1761054113/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761054986","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://vid